An event occurrence usage is declared like an occurrence usage, as described in 7.9.2 , 7.9.3 , and 7.9.4 , but using
the kind keyword event occurrence instead of just occurrence. It is related to another occurrence usage,
representing the occurring event, by a reference subsetting relationsh

