out process;
}
flow getProcessByID.process to terminateProcess.terminatedProcess;
action terminateProccess terminate {
in terminatedProcess;
}
}

The base terminate action usage is terminateActions from the Actions library model (see 9.2.9), which is
defined by TerminateAction. (See 8.4.13.8 for additional semantic constraints on terminate action usages.)

